Cursor Web/Agents use an HTTPS OAuth callback. Cursor Desktop OAuth uses the private-use callback `cursor://anysphere.cursor-mcp/oauth/callback`, which OpenWork accepts through an exact allowlist with PKCE S256 enforced, so intercepted authorization codes cannot be redeemed without the code verifier.

